msgid "Resuming"
msgstr "Reanudación"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/download.md:96
msgid ""
"`--resume` is on by default. It means **skip scenes that are already "
"complete**, not \"continue a partial file\":"
msgstr ""
